      "parentId": "ingestion-offset-fix",
      "interfaceIds": [],
      "typeIds": [],
      "kind": "block",
      "lines": [
        "Blue = every-second path: one stat per known file",
        "Green = read only the new bytes",
        "Amber = the demoted walk (watcher event or 60s sweep only)",
        "Violet node = new file · Blue node = changed file · Grey = unchanged"
